# Response headers for every path, read by Cloudflare (Workers static assets).
# Not served to visitors. Rationale and rollback: RFC 0003 (P5 and P6).
# A header repeated here is joined with a comma, so keep this single block and
# replace a header instead of adding a second one.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'none'; img-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
